<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ stream-unnamed · stream-malformed · stream-forked · prev-unknown · note-needed · note-one-line · note-too-long · to-malformed · field-one-line · msg-absent · msg-not-yours · msg-answered · msg-followed · wiki-not-anchored

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`stream-unnamed` params=`cure/[[engine.msg.lands stream/<pet>#<n> note/<one-line>]] ~ a msg names the stream it writes as`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`stream-malformed` params=`cure/[[engine.msg.lands stream/<pet>#<n> note/<one-line>]] ~ a stream reads <pet>#<n>, lowercase and hyphen-joined`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`stream-forked` params=`~ the stream shows two heads or more; the answer names each as a call with prev set`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`prev-unknown` params=`~ prev names no entry of the stream this view holds; read the stream's heads`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`note-needed` params=`cure/[[engine.msg.lands stream/<pet>#<n> note/<one-line>]] ~ a landing carries one line of note`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`note-one-line` params=`~ a note holds one line`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`note-too-long` params=`~ a note holds 72 characters or fewer; a longer thought rides about as a pointer`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`to-malformed` params=`~ to names an entity or one instance`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`field-one-line` params=`~ a panel or pointer field holds one line`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`msg-absent` params=`~ the retract names no entry this view holds, or the stream holds none`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`msg-not-yours` params=`~ a retract withdraws the caller's own entry; a reply answers another's`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`msg-answered` params=`~ a record names the entry in re, so it stands in the history; a reply corrects it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`msg-followed` params=`~ a later entry of the stream names it as prev; withdraw the head first`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-not-anchored` params=`~ a msg reads its stream in a wiki's own engine; a bag names none`>>
```

