<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed · founded · inbox · retracted · exists · dry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[title stream prev root decision bag layer hash]] ~ the entry landed through the put law; decision reads put`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`founded` params=`exit/0 fields/[[founded root]] ~ the first msg of a stream founded its root beside the entry`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`inbox` params=`exit/0 fields/[[stream inbox total]] ~ the unseen entries addressed to the stream, each with its has line`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`retracted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[title decision withheld]] ~ the caller's own unanswered entry left`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`exists` params=`exit/4 ~ the same birth fields already landed this entry; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`dry` params=`exit/0 fields/[[dry needs founds]] ~ a dry landing: what the entry's put would land; nothing landed`>>
```

